 test_a=[('Interpret r=-0.92 in terms of direction and linear strength.','Strong negative linear association.'),('A study finds a positive correlation between shoe size and reading ability in children. Does larger shoe size cause better reading? Give a plausible alternative.','No; age/development could influence both.')],
